   - Allows users to filter between their tasks, assigned tasks, completed, or all tasks.
   - Clickable—filters main task list instantly.

3. Main Content Area
   - Top: Dashboard Summary highlights key stats (e.g., total tasks, next due).
   - Date Navigation: Browse tasks due in selected week with prev/next.
   - Primary: Task List Table—shows all tasks (Title, Due, Project, Status, and row actions: Edit/Delete).
   - [+ New Task] is primary CTA for creating a task. “Bulk Actions” enables managing multiple tasks at once (e.g., complete/delete).
   - All rows have quick Edit/Delete affordances for clarity and efficiency.

4. Fixed Footer
   - Persistent access to Help, Privacy, Contact info.
   - Remains visible on all pages for accessibility and support.

Navigation & Interactions:
- Users move between modules via top nav; filter tasks with left sub-menu.
- Dashboard always exposes current system status (counts, next due, etc).
- All interactions are visible and clearly labeled. Table rows afford quick task management.
- Prominent action button to add tasks encourages primary workflow.

